  "bodyHash": "7f9cbfa1695d7640",
  "content": "\n\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>JourneyMap-Teams</strong></span></h4>\n<p>這是一個適用於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252fen%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt </a>的客戶端與伺服器端模組，作為 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap </a>的外掛，可與支援的團隊模組及原版團隊功能進行整合。&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>說明與文件</strong></span></h4>\n<p>可在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/eP8gE69\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap Discord </a>伺服器尋求支援。</p>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>伺服器端</strong> </span>- <em>選填</em></h4>\n<p>隱藏非你隊伍成員或盟友的玩家。&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">客戶端</span> </span></strong>- <em>選填</em></h4>\n<p>根據隊伍顏色為隊友圖示與名稱標籤上色。此功能亦包含盟友。</p>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>支援的團隊模組：</strong></span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>FTB Teams：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-forge/\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>&nbsp;與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li>Vanilla Teams</li>\n<li>BetterTeams（透過 Paper 插件）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如需支援更多團隊模組，歡迎提出請求。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
